{"id":"20.04.DemoMainMenu","contentHtml":"<p>This project is my technical research, in which I created a complex UI with a fusion effect (metaballs) from scratch on a single HLSL shader.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Goal:</strong> achieve maximum performance by rendering the entire interface <strong>procedurally, in a single pass</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The demonstration received high praise in the professional community on <mark><strong>LinkedIn</strong> (200+ reactions, dozens of comments)</mark>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<p>The entire system is built on a single shader, which allowed achieving maximum efficiency.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Procedural Generation on GPU:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>The entire UI, including buttons (except icons) and waves, is generated procedurally based on <strong>distance fields</strong>.</li>\n<li>This approach <mark>guarantees the absence of overdraw</mark>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Flexible Control from C#:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Interactivity is implemented via a controlling C# script that passes element positions to the shader and animates their parameters using <code>DOTween</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Optimization via <code>Shader Variants</code>:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>To increase performance, the shader uses <strong>compiled variants</strong>, which allows disabling unused parts of the code in real-time.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>High-Performance Solution:</strong> Successfully implemented a complex and dynamic UI, rendered in <strong>one pass</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>High Community Praise:</strong> The project sparked active discussion on LinkedIn, confirming the novelty and quality of the engineering solution.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Competency:</strong> The project proves the ability to create innovative, high-performance visual systems from scratch, with a deep understanding of the GPU pipeline and <code>HLSL</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Demo Main Menu","date":"2020-04","type":"project","tagsArray":["Demo","Mobile","Unity","C#","Photoshop","HLSL","DOTween"],"heroVideo":["n6FaeYvLJ7o"],"shortDescription":"<p>Tech demo: <mark>High-performance procedural UI</mark> with a metaballs effect, fully rendered by a single shader in one pass.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://www.linkedin.com/posts/dishib_unity3d-activity-6733838641635852288-Rz9v/"],"role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/20.04.DemoMainMenu/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/20.04.DemoMainMenu/card.video?v=1765111431526&webm=1&mp4=1","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/20.04.DemoMainMenu/screenshots/1.webp","width":526,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/20.04.DemoMainMenu/screenshots/2.webp","width":528,"height":940},{"src":"/images/projects/20.04.DemoMainMenu/screenshots/3.webp","width":526,"height":936}]}